(7459743, 1182483, 179769, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2016-06-10 12:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459746, 1182613, 179769, '<td valign="top">A really beautiful still life.  Lighting is impressive...and perfect.</td>', 'A really beautiful still life.  Lighting is impressive...and perfect.', '2016-06-10 12:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459749, 1182483, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!</td>', 'Outstanding!', '2016-06-10 13:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459750, 1182613, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and light.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and light.', '2016-06-10 13:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459751, 1182646, 10848, '<td valign="top">Love this! Excellent composition, the facial expression is priceless. My favorite! Giving this a 10 in hopes for a well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Love this! Excellent composition, the facial expression is priceless. My favorite! Giving this a 10 in hopes for a well deserved ribbon.', '2016-06-10 13:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459752, 1182629, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the message this portrays, serenity and simplistic life. Gorgeous as a painting.</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the message this portrays, serenity and simplistic life. Gorgeous as a painting.', '2016-06-10 13:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459753, 1182376, 181814, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph and the postprocessing is very well done. The focus the exposure and the composition are all very nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this photograph and the postprocessing is very well done. The focus the exposure and the composition are all very nicely done.', '2016-06-10 13:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459755, 1182472, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think the subject matter the composition and such are very well done, however I think you overdid it a bit the filter.</td>', 'I think the subject matter the composition and such are very well done, however I think you overdid it a bit the filter.', '2016-06-10 13:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459756, 1182519, 181814, '<td valign="top">Great-looking photograph with nice color scheme and the postprocessing is well done, it does look like a piece of artwork in my opinion.</td>', 'Great-looking photograph with nice color scheme and the postprocessing is well done, it does look like a piece of artwork in my opinion.', '2016-06-10 13:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459757, 1182640, 181814, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done, it looks like a painting that would look nice hanging on the wall.</td>', 'This is very nicely done, it looks like a painting that would look nice hanging on the wall.', '2016-06-10 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459758, 1182641, 181814, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph, I like the blurred effect it makes it look really good.</td>', 'Very nice photograph, I like the blurred effect it makes it look really good.', '2016-06-10 13:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459759, 1182550, 181814, '<td valign="top">I actually like the photograph and the pose of the model. The post processing is very well done for the most part, on the skin of the hand and the upper torso kind of looks weird in some way in my opinion, but I did give it a good score because I do like it.</td>', 'I actually like the photograph and the pose of the model. The post processing is very well done for the most part, on the skin of the hand and the upper torso kind of looks weird in some way in my opinion, but I did give it a good score because I do like it.', '2016-06-10 13:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459760, 1182482, 181814, '<td valign="top">This is extremely well done This is extremely well done, I like the exposure and composition.</td>', 'This is extremely well done This is extremely well done, I like the exposure and composition.', '2016-06-10 13:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459761, 1182613, 181814, '<td valign="top">I really like this entry, what I like about it especially are the bright colors and the focus. The exposure is extremely well done and I think it should do well in this contest.</td>', 'I really like this entry, what I like about it especially are the bright colors and the focus. The exposure is extremely well done and I think it should do well in this contest.', '2016-06-10 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459779, 1182472, 10785, '<td valign="top">Super joyful and well captured. I do think the art filter is over-applied in the post-process. It looks pretty good everywhere except on the skin, especially the legs of the kids. Definitely a "Snapshot" of life, a defining moment!</td>', 'Super joyful and well captured. I do think the art filter is over-applied in the post-process. It looks pretty good everywhere except on the skin, especially the legs of the kids. Definitely a "Snapshot" of life, a defining moment!', '2016-06-10 15:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459780, 1182619, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is good for a snapshot of life. As I review paintings of Manet I don''t really see the backs of people as the interesting focus of the snapshot. There are always people facing the viewer in his images. Good post production.</td>', 'This is good for a snapshot of life. As I review paintings of Manet I don''t really see the backs of people as the interesting focus of the snapshot. There are always people facing the viewer in his images. Good post production.', '2016-06-10 15:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459782, 1182642, 50864, '<td valign="top">I don''t think Manet could have done something this good. Easily my top pick. 10 and fav</td>', 'I don''t think Manet could have done something this good. Easily my top pick. 10 and fav', '2016-06-10 16:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459829, 1182376, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think Manet was working mostly in oil paint</td>', 'I think Manet was working mostly in oil paint', '2016-06-11 10:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459830, 1182629, 50695, '<td valign="top">looks more like Seurat</td>', 'looks more like Seurat', '2016-06-11 10:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459831, 1182656, 50695, '<td valign="top">the composition is a little drab but the painting technique is very similar to his Boats at Sea painting.</td>', 'the composition is a little drab but the painting technique is very similar to his Boats at Sea painting.', '2016-06-11 10:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459832, 1182472, 50695, '<td valign="top">In a Manet painting, at this resolution, you would barely be able to see the brushstrokes. I do like the subject matter, though.</td>', 'In a Manet painting, at this resolution, you would barely be able to see the brushstrokes. I do like the subject matter, though.', '2016-06-11 10:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459833, 1182669, 50695, '<td valign="top">I really got a kick out of this. The combination of the outright flouting of the challenge and these two guys gazing goofily into the camera is just hilarious for some reason.</td>', 'I really got a kick out of this. The combination of the outright flouting of the challenge and these two guys gazing goofily into the camera is just hilarious for some reason.', '2016-06-11 10:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459866, 1182474, 59029, '<td valign="top">why the fake tail?</td>', 'why the fake tail?', '2016-06-11 21:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459904, 1182472, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nicely done from subject to editing.</td>', 'Nicely done from subject to editing.', '2016-06-12 18:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459907, 1182669, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the image, capturing two looks heading in opposite direction.  I also like black and white.  I am not an authority, but I think Manet would have done it in color.</td>', 'I like the image, capturing two looks heading in opposite direction.  I also like black and white.  I am not an authority, but I think Manet would have done it in color.', '2016-06-12 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7459908, 1182646, 170281, '<td valign="top">I think this is what Manet would have liked.  Maybe not provocative and controversial, but it tells a story through expression, position and framing.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I think this is what Manet would have liked.  Maybe not provocative and controversial, but it tells a story through expression, position and framing.  Nicely done.', '2016-06-12 18:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460133, 1182472, 15511, '<td valign="top">This is a fun image, but the filter is not pleasing to me.</td>', 'This is a fun image, but the filter is not pleasing to me.', '2016-06-14 01:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
