(7460533, 1182602, 102278, '<td valign="top">Ha! The man taking a bite of his food is the thing i like most about the photo. The photo is all about what people are focusing on. I''d have been less inclined to submit the photo without the man as, as far as I can see, he makes it a far more interetsting photo. Thanks for the comment though, Anita. Much appreciated.</td>', 'Ha! The man taking a bite of his food is the thing i like most about the photo. The photo is all about what people are focusing on. I''d have been less inclined to submit the photo without the man as, as far as I can see, he makes it a far more interetsting photo. Thanks for the comment though, Anita. Much appreciated.', '2016-06-17 03:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
