(7460539, 1182602, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rooum:</b></div><hr/><i> Ha! The man taking a bite of his food is the thing i like most about the photo. The photo is all about what people are focusing on. I''d have been less inclined to submit the photo without the man as, as far as I can see, he makes it a far more interetsting photo. Thanks for the comment though, Anita. Much appreciated. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha, and that''s exactly what I thought you would think, but that''s good, imagine if we all thought the same!</td>', 'Originally posted by rooum: Ha! The man taking a bite of his food is the thing i like most about the photo. The photo is all about what people are focusing on. I''d have been less inclined to submit the photo without the man as, as far as I can see, he makes it a far more interetsting photo. Thanks for the comment though, Anita. Much appreciated.   Ha, and that''s exactly what I thought you would think, but that''s good, imagine if we all thought the same!', '2016-06-17 05:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7460540, 1182602, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rooum:</b></div><hr/><i> Ha! The man taking a bite of his food is the thing i like most about the photo. The photo is all about what people are focusing on. I''d have been less inclined to submit the photo without the man as, as far as I can see, he makes it a far more interetsting photo. Thanks for the comment though, Anita. Much appreciated. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Definitely. It''s good that people can see a photo in so many different ways. I do get your point...the photo would be ''cleaner'' and less jumbled both in composition and underlying themes but, as I say, I think less interesting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-06-17 04:30:55.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by rooum: Ha! The man taking a bite of his food is the thing i like most about the photo. The photo is all about what people are focusing on. I''d have been less inclined to submit the photo without the man as, as far as I can see, he makes it a far more interetsting photo. Thanks for the comment though, Anita. Much appreciated.   Definitely. It''s good that people can see a photo in so many different ways. I do get your point...the photo would be ''cleaner'' and less jumbled both in composition and underlying themes but, as I say, I think less interesting.', '2016-06-17 05:30:31.000000', '2016-06-17 05:30:55.000000', 0),
